# R session junk
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# bookdown build intermediates.
# The leading slash anchors these to the project root. Without it, `*_files/`
# also matched docs/stats-econometrics-r_files/ — the rendered figures — and
# silently kept every plot in the book out of the published site.
/_bookdown_files/
/*_files/
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md
*.rds

# NOTE: docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. GitHub Pages serves the book from
# it, so the rendered output must be committed.

# Anything holding identifying student data must never be committed.
# The class survey in data/ is anonymised to S01-S33; if you ever keep a
# name -> id key locally, name it to match this pattern.
*-identifying.csv
*-namekey.csv
private/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# LaTeX build noise
*.log
*.aux
*.toc
*.out
*.tex

# Stray device output R sometimes leaves behind
Rplots.pdf
